{"id":1600,"bangumiId":1600,"type":2,"name":"BLEACH","name_cn":"死神","date":"2004-10-05","year":"2004","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/9e/98/1600_dLcNL.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/9e/98/1600_dLcNL.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/9e/98/1600_dLcNL.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/9e/98/1600_dLcNL.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/9e/98/1600_dLcNL.jpg"},"summary":"橘发少年黑崎一护是个正义感爆棚的高中生，与父亲、两个妹妹共同生活，从小他就有能看见鬼魂的本事，但并不以为意。一天夜里一只叫“虚”的怪物攻击了一护和他的家人，尾随怪物而来的死神朽木露琪亚身负重伤，只得将灵力转给一护，由他代死神之职。岂料“代职”一发不可收拾，一段时间后，尸魂界发现露琪亚的违规行为，来人将她抓走。为救出朋友，一护在浦原商店店主浦原喜助的帮助下，集结了井上织姬、石田雨龙、茶渡泰虎几位好友，一同前往尸魂界。与此同时，尸魂界瀞灵廷内一场惊天阴谋也在慢慢掀开……","rating":{"rank":1495,"total":5694,"count":{"1":14,"2":8,"3":34,"4":71,"5":279,"6":878,"7":2014,"8":1578,"9":485,"10":333},"score":7.3},"collection":{"on_hold":1398,"dropped":672,"wish":1951,"collect":8198,"doing":2268},"tags":[{"name":"BLEACH","count":1237,"total_count":2698},{"name":"热血","count":1198,"total_count":221169},{"name":"死神","count":1148,"total_count":4476},{"name":"2004","count":870,"total_count":24703},{"name":"久保带人","count":741,"total_count":1463},{"name":"民工","count":702,"total_count":4487},{"name":"TV","count":589,"total_count":1458752},{"name":"JUMP","count":533,"total_count":33977},{"name":"漫画改","count":502,"total_count":900346},{"name":"战斗","count":462,"total_count":496186},{"name":"斩魄刀","count":301,"total_count":306},{"name":"2004年10月","count":257,"total_count":2188},{"name":"StudioPierrot","count":221,"total_count":12518},{"name":"不说啥了","count":194,"total_count":209},{"name":"漫改","count":140,"total_count":373203},{"name":"奇幻","count":91,"total_count":498600},{"name":"日本","count":90,"total_count":322016},{"name":"BL—EACH","count":83,"total_count":83},{"name":"破面","count":54,"total_count":54},{"name":"原创中","count":39,"total_count":40},{"name":"长篇","count":37,"total_count":2182},{"name":"假面","count":35,"total_count":39},{"name":"ぴ